// Anonymous usage counts (TelemetryDeck; decisions/2026-11-17-analytics-build.md). Committed on purpose: the app ID is
// not a secret (it ships inside every build), like the relay token.
//
// Paste the TelemetryDeck app ID below (TelemetryDeck dashboard → the app → its "App ID", a UUID) and rebuild.
// No `xcodegen generate` needed. EMPTY = analytics off in every build (no SDK start, nothing sent).
// Round 44 (Haylee): there is NO switch. With an ID, counts are always on for everyone (disclosed in the privacy policy
// and in Grown-ups → About what we save); installs that had the old switch are moved to on at launch.
// Debug builds send in TelemetryDeck's Test mode; Release builds send live. Debug runs can pass `-PTAnalyticsOff`
// (DEBUG only) to send nothing for that run.
TELEMETRYDECK_APP_ID = C0AFCF1C-CCB0-48EF-A5D9-F40E63764249
